        "title": "Rianra mei guai naidat lak khe",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Ryanramei guai naidat lak khe ,",
            "Bumaeng kandih gaipui ram khou,",
            "Kanloumei guai bam puni e,",
            "Aniu kandi hei kum makge.",
            "",
            "Rianramei lunghgeihmei rui duamliam,",
            "Rian ra meirui dui kum ma dailiam ,",
            "Gai na hei ram tei guang tang pukhou,",
            "",
            "2. Hei kandih mu hei kun makge ,",
            "Rianra khang na kap pui ram e.",
            "Kanpat lou o bamcham diu khang,",
            "Neihlaa mei guay akhang suna.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih khou hei tamkanmei guai,",
            "Ata kau e duipaeng ram khou,",
            "Gaipuiram khou tei guangdiu khang,",
            "Kaniuban tei ham ma kau e.",
            "",
            "4. He! Nthuk e Poubaomei zei",
            "Rianramei guai nangpan khou rui,",
            "Gaipuiram tei guang tang nuh the,",
            "Kandih ryanraram pat louna."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
